[["Map",1,2,9,10,68,69],"meta::meta",["Map",3,4,5,6,7,8],"astro-version","5.18.2","content-config-digest","15ad9755570666a1","astro-config-digest","{\"root\":{},\"srcDir\":{},\"publicDir\":{},\"outDir\":{},\"cacheDir\":{},\"site\":\"https://your-site.com\",\"compressHTML\":true,\"base\":\"/\",\"trailingSlash\":\"ignore\",\"output\":\"static\",\"scopedStyleStrategy\":\"attribute\",\"build\":{\"format\":\"directory\",\"client\":{},\"server\":{},\"assets\":\"_astro\",\"serverEntry\":\"entry.mjs\",\"redirects\":true,\"inlineStylesheets\":\"auto\",\"concurrency\":1},\"server\":{\"open\":false,\"host\":false,\"port\":4321,\"streaming\":true,\"allowedHosts\":[]},\"redirects\":{},\"image\":{\"endpoint\":{\"route\":\"/_image\"},\"service\":{\"entrypoint\":\"astro/assets/services/sharp\",\"config\":{}},\"domains\":[],\"remotePatterns\":[],\"responsiveStyles\":false},\"devToolbar\":{\"enabled\":true},\"markdown\":{\"syntaxHighlight\":{\"type\":\"shiki\",\"excludeLangs\":[\"math\"]},\"shikiConfig\":{\"langs\":[],\"langAlias\":{},\"theme\":\"github-dark\",\"themes\":{},\"wrap\":true,\"transformers\":[]},\"remarkPlugins\":[],\"rehypePlugins\":[],\"remarkRehype\":{},\"gfm\":true,\"smartypants\":true},\"security\":{\"checkOrigin\":true,\"allowedDomains\":[],\"actionBodySizeLimit\":1048576},\"env\":{\"schema\":{},\"validateSecrets\":false},\"experimental\":{\"clientPrerender\":false,\"contentIntellisense\":false,\"headingIdCompat\":false,\"preserveScriptOrder\":false,\"liveContentCollections\":false,\"csp\":false,\"staticImportMetaEnv\":false,\"chromeDevtoolsWorkspace\":false,\"failOnPrerenderConflict\":false,\"svgo\":false},\"legacy\":{\"collections\":false}}","projects",["Map",11,12,31,32,50,51],"ai-dashboard",{"id":11,"data":13,"body":27,"filePath":28,"digest":29,"legacyId":30,"deferredRender":26},{"title":14,"date":15,"summary":16,"tags":17,"coverImage":23,"githubUrl":24,"liveUrl":25,"featured":26},"AI Dashboard",["Date","2024-01-15T00:00:00.000Z"],"基于机器学习的智能数据分析平台，支持实时可视化与预测分析。",[18,19,20,21,22],"React","Python","TensorFlow","D3.js","FastAPI","https://placehold.co/800x500/18181b/00d9ff?text=AI+Dashboard","https://github.com/username/ai-dashboard","https://ai-dashboard.demo.com",true,"## 项目概述\n\n这是一个现代化的数据分析仪表盘，集成了 AI 预测功能，帮助企业做出数据驱动的决策。\n\n## 核心功能\n\n- 实时数据可视化\n- AI 驱动的预测分析\n- 自定义报表生成\n- 多数据源集成\n\n## 技术栈\n\n本项目使用 React 构建前端界面，Python FastAPI 作为后端服务，结合 TensorFlow 进行机器学习模型训练。\n\n```python\nimport tensorflow as tf\nfrom sklearn.preprocessing import StandardScaler\n\nmodel = tf.keras.Sequential([\n    tf.keras.layers.Dense(64, activation='relu'),\n    tf.keras.layers.Dense(32, activation='relu'),\n    tf.keras.layers.Dense(1, activation='sigmoid')\n])\n\nmodel.compile(optimizer='adam', loss='binary_crossentropy', metrics=['accuracy'])\n```\n\n## 部署\n\n项目支持 Docker 部署，可以在任何云平台上快速启动。","src/content/projects/ai-dashboard.mdx","324db073e1a97a76","ai-dashboard.mdx","ecommerce-platform",{"id":31,"data":33,"body":46,"filePath":47,"digest":48,"legacyId":49,"deferredRender":26},{"title":34,"date":35,"summary":36,"tags":37,"coverImage":43,"githubUrl":44,"liveUrl":45,"featured":26},"E-Commerce Platform",["Date","2024-03-20T00:00:00.000Z"],"功能完整的电商解决方案，包含前后端和支付系统集成。",[38,39,40,41,42],"Next.js","Node.js","PostgreSQL","Stripe","TypeScript","https://placehold.co/800x500/18181b/6366f1?text=E-Commerce","https://github.com/username/ecommerce","https://shop.demo.com","## 项目概述\n\n这是一个功能完整的电商平台，提供从浏览到支付的全流程购物体验。\n\n## 核心功能\n\n- 用户认证与权限管理\n- 商品分类与搜索\n- 购物车管理\n- 订单处理系统\n- Stripe 支付集成\n\n## 技术亮点\n\n使用 Next.js 14 的 App Router 构建，采用 Server Components 提升性能。\n\n```typescript\nexport default async function ProductPage({ params }: { params: { id: string } }) {\n  const product = await getProduct(params.id);\n  return \u003CProductDetail product={product} />;\n}\n```","src/content/projects/ecommerce-platform.mdx","7f148b9818261836","ecommerce-platform.mdx","realtime-chat",{"id":50,"data":52,"body":64,"filePath":65,"digest":66,"legacyId":67,"deferredRender":26},{"title":53,"date":54,"summary":55,"tags":56,"coverImage":61,"githubUrl":62,"liveUrl":63,"featured":26},"Real-time Chat App",["Date","2024-05-10T00:00:00.000Z"],"基于 WebSocket 的实时聊天应用，支持私聊和群组功能。",[57,58,39,59,60],"Vue.js","Socket.io","MongoDB","Redis","https://placehold.co/800x500/18181b/00d9ff?text=Chat+App","https://github.com/username/chat-app","https://chat.demo.com","## 项目概述\n\n一个现代化的即时通讯应用，提供流畅的实时聊天体验。\n\n## 核心功能\n\n- 实时消息推送\n- 群聊管理\n- 文件与图片分享\n- 消息已读/未读状态\n- 在线状态显示\n\n## 技术实现\n\n使用 Socket.io 实现 WebSocket 双向通信，Redis 用于消息缓存。\n\n```javascript\nio.on('connection', (socket) => {\n  socket.on('join-room', (roomId) => {\n    socket.join(roomId);\n    io.to(roomId).emit('user-joined', socket.id);\n  });\n\n  socket.on('send-message', ({ roomId, message }) => {\n    io.to(roomId).emit('receive-message', {\n      id: Date.now(),\n      text: message,\n      sender: socket.id,\n    });\n  });\n});\n```","src/content/projects/realtime-chat.mdx","624ea732b64ac977","realtime-chat.mdx","blog",["Map",70,71,106,107,143,144],"getting-started-astro-5",{"id":70,"data":72,"body":81,"filePath":82,"digest":83,"rendered":84,"legacyId":105},{"title":73,"date":74,"summary":75,"tags":76,"draft":80},"Getting Started with Astro 5",["Date","2024-06-15T00:00:00.000Z"],"深入了解 Astro 5 的新特性和改进，学习如何使用 Content Collections 构建内容驱动的网站。",[77,78,79],"Astro","Web Development","SSG",false,"## 介绍\n\nAstro 5 是最新版本的 Astro 框架，带来了许多令人兴奋的新特性和改进。在这篇文章中，我们将深入了解这些变化。\n\n## Content Collections\n\nAstro 5 增强了 Content Collections 功能，提供了更好的类型安全和开发体验。\n\n```typescript\nimport { defineCollection, z } from 'astro:content';\n\nconst blog = defineCollection({\n  type: 'content',\n  schema: z.object({\n    title: z.string(),\n    publishDate: z.date(),\n    tags: z.array(z.string()),\n  }),\n});\n```\n\n## 为什么选择 Astro？\n\n1. **零 JavaScript 默认** - 页面默认不加载 JavaScript\n2. ** islands 架构** - 只在需要交互的地方加载 JS\n3. **Content Collections** - 类型安全的内容管理\n4. **内置图片优化** - 自动优化图片性能\n\n## 总结\n\nAstro 5 是一个强大的静态站点生成框架，非常适合内容驱动的网站。","src/content/blog/getting-started-astro-5.md","f137a0842b9dc3c3",{"html":85,"metadata":86},"\u003Ch2 id=\"介绍\">介绍\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Astro 5 是最新版本的 Astro 框架，带来了许多令人兴奋的新特性和改进。在这篇文章中，我们将深入了解这些变化。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"content-collections\">Content Collections\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Astro 5 增强了 Content Collections 功能，提供了更好的类型安全和开发体验。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"typescript\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">import\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> { defineCollection, z } \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">from\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\"> 'astro:content'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">const\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\"> blog\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\"> =\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\"> defineCollection\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">({\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  type: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#9ECBFF\">'content'\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  schema: z.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">object\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">({\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    title: z.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">string\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(),\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    publishDate: z.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">date\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(),\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">    tags: z.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">array\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(z.\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">string\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">()),\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  }),\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">});\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"为什么选择-astro\">为什么选择 Astro？\u003C/h2>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>零 JavaScript 默认\u003C/strong> - 页面默认不加载 JavaScript\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>** islands 架构** - 只在需要交互的地方加载 JS\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>Content Collections\u003C/strong> - 类型安全的内容管理\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>\u003Cstrong>内置图片优化\u003C/strong> - 自动优化图片性能\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"总结\">总结\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Astro 5 是一个强大的静态站点生成框架，非常适合内容驱动的网站。\u003C/p>",{"headings":87,"localImagePaths":99,"remoteImagePaths":100,"frontmatter":101,"imagePaths":104},[88,91,94,97],{"depth":89,"slug":90,"text":90},2,"介绍",{"depth":89,"slug":92,"text":93},"content-collections","Content Collections",{"depth":89,"slug":95,"text":96},"为什么选择-astro","为什么选择 Astro？",{"depth":89,"slug":98,"text":98},"总结",[],[],{"title":73,"summary":75,"date":102,"tags":103,"draft":80},["Date","2024-06-15T00:00:00.000Z"],[77,78,79],[],"getting-started-astro-5.md","tailwind-css-4-guide",{"id":106,"data":108,"body":116,"filePath":117,"digest":118,"rendered":119,"legacyId":142},{"title":109,"date":110,"summary":111,"tags":112,"draft":80},"Building Modern UIs with Tailwind CSS 4",["Date","2024-05-20T00:00:00.000Z"],"探索 Tailwind CSS 4 的新特性和最佳实践，学习如何高效构建现代化用户界面。",[113,114,115],"Tailwind CSS","CSS","UI Design","## 简介\n\nTailwind CSS 4 带来了全新的架构和改进，让样式开发更加高效和愉快。\n\n## 新特性\n\n### 原生 CSS 变量\n\nTailwind CSS 4 使用 CSS 原生变量，不再需要 PostCSS 插件。\n\n```css\n@theme {\n  --color-primary: #00d9ff;\n  --color-secondary: #6366f1;\n}\n\n.button {\n  background-color: var(--color-primary);\n}\n```\n\n### 改进的性能\n\n新的引擎大幅提升了构建速度和开发体验。\n\n## 最佳实践\n\n1. 使用 `@apply` 提取重复样式\n2. 利用 CSS 变量实现主题切换\n3. 组合使用工具类\n\n## 总结\n\nTailwind CSS 4 是现代 CSS 开发的重要进步，值得深入学习。","src/content/blog/tailwind-css-4-guide.md","80239030ded73fc5",{"html":120,"metadata":121},"\u003Ch2 id=\"简介\">简介\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Tailwind CSS 4 带来了全新的架构和改进，让样式开发更加高效和愉快。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"新特性\">新特性\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"原生-css-变量\">原生 CSS 变量\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>Tailwind CSS 4 使用 CSS 原生变量，不再需要 PostCSS 插件。\u003C/p>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"css\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#F97583\">@theme\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  --color-primary: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FDAEB7;font-style:italic\">#00d9ff\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  --color-secondary: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FDAEB7;font-style:italic\">#6366f1\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">;\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#B392F0\">.button\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\"> {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">  background-color\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">var\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">(\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#FFAB70\">--color-primary\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">);\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"改进的性能\">改进的性能\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cp>新的引擎大幅提升了构建速度和开发体验。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践\u003C/h2>\n\u003Col>\n\u003Cli>使用 \u003Ccode>@apply\u003C/code> 提取重复样式\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>利用 CSS 变量实现主题切换\u003C/li>\n\u003Cli>组合使用工具类\u003C/li>\n\u003C/ol>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"总结\">总结\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>Tailwind CSS 4 是现代 CSS 开发的重要进步，值得深入学习。\u003C/p>",{"headings":122,"localImagePaths":136,"remoteImagePaths":137,"frontmatter":138,"imagePaths":141},[123,125,127,131,133,135],{"depth":89,"slug":124,"text":124},"简介",{"depth":89,"slug":126,"text":126},"新特性",{"depth":128,"slug":129,"text":130},3,"原生-css-变量","原生 CSS 变量",{"depth":128,"slug":132,"text":132},"改进的性能",{"depth":89,"slug":134,"text":134},"最佳实践",{"depth":89,"slug":98,"text":98},[],[],{"title":109,"summary":111,"date":139,"tags":140,"draft":80},["Date","2024-05-20T00:00:00.000Z"],[113,114,115],[],"tailwind-css-4-guide.md","typescript-best-practices",{"id":143,"data":145,"body":152,"filePath":153,"digest":154,"rendered":155,"legacyId":179},{"title":146,"date":147,"summary":148,"tags":149,"draft":80},"TypeScript Best Practices for 2024",["Date","2024-04-10T00:00:00.000Z"],"掌握现代 TypeScript 开发的核心最佳实践，提升代码质量和开发效率。",[42,150,151],"JavaScript","Best Practices","## 概述\n\nTypeScript 已成为现代 Web 开发的标准配置。掌握最佳实践对于构建可维护的大型项目至关重要。\n\n## 核心最佳实践\n\n### 使用 strict 模式\n\n```json\n{\n  \"compilerOptions\": {\n    \"strict\": true,\n    \"noImplicitAny\": true,\n    \"strictNullChecks\": true\n  }\n}\n```\n\n### 类型推断 vs 显式类型\n\n```typescript\n// 好的：利用类型推断\nconst numbers = [1, 2, 3];\nconst doubled = numbers.map((n) => n * 2);\n\n// 好的：显式类型用于复杂对象\ninterface User {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  email: string;\n}\n\nfunction createUser(data: User): User {\n  return { ...data, id: crypto.randomUUID() };\n}\n```\n\n### Discriminated Unions\n\n```typescript\ntype Result =\n  | { success: true; data: User }\n  | { success: false; error: string };\n\nfunction handleResult(result: Result) {\n  if (result.success) {\n    console.log(result.data.name);\n  } else {\n    console.error(result.error);\n  }\n}\n```\n\n## 总结\n\n遵循这些最佳实践将帮助你编写更健壮的 TypeScript 代码。","src/content/blog/typescript-best-practices.md","8c405a48e8ca6d38",{"html":156,"metadata":157},"\u003Ch2 id=\"概述\">概述\u003C/h2>\n\u003Cp>TypeScript 已成为现代 Web 开发的标准配置。掌握最佳实践对于构建可维护的大型项目至关重要。\u003C/p>\n\u003Ch2 id=\"核心最佳实践\">核心最佳实践\u003C/h2>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"使用-strict-模式\">使用 strict 模式\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e8; overflow-x: auto; white-space: pre-wrap; word-wrap: break-word;\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"json\">\u003Ccode>\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">{\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">  \"compilerOptions\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: {\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">    \"strict\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">true\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">    \"noImplicitAny\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">true\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">,\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">    \"strictNullChecks\"\u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">: \u003C/span>\u003Cspan style=\"color:#79B8FF\">true\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">  }\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\n\u003Cspan class=\"line\">\u003Cspan style=\"color:#E1E4E8\">}\u003C/span>\u003C/span>\u003C/code>\u003C/pre>\n\u003Ch3 id=\"类型推断-vs-显式类型\">类型推断 vs 显式类型\u003C/h3>\n\u003Cpre class=\"astro-code github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#24292e;color:#e1e4e